{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "hjweno_norm_1d_eikonal_dirichlet_mms",
    "description": "Method-of-manufactured-solutions order-of-accuracy driver for grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/rules/hjweno_norm_D1_dirichlet_bc on the unit interval [0,1] with inhomogeneous DIRICHLET (state-constraint) boundaries, the Dirichlet companion of problems/hjweno_norm_1d_eikonal_mms.esm (periodic). Forced-steady eikonal u_t = -S|u_x| + S|g'(x)| with g(x) = sin(2 pi x) + 0.5 + x: u_t = -S|g'| + S|g'| = 0 continuously, so g is exact for all t and is the analytic reference. Discretely u_t = S*(|g'| - hjweno(u)); the imbalance is the fifth-order HJ-WENO-Z truncation S*(|g'| - hjweno(g)) = O(dx^5), so ||u(T) - g|| = O(dx^5) (expected order 5). Prescribed walls gL = g(0) = 0.5, gR = g(1) = 1.5. g is SMOOTH everywhere (it is |u_x|, not u, that has kinks, at the u_x = 0 critical points near x = 0.275, 0.725), so the WENO-Z one-sided reconstructions stay fifth order INCLUDING at those critical points (WENO-Z tau_5 weights, Borges 2008), and the Godunov max/min resolves the |grad| kinks. THE BOUNDARY RETAINS FIFTH ORDER: g = sin(2 pi x) + linear is antisymmetric about x=0 and x=1, so the antisymmetric mirror ghosts (u[0]=2gL-u[1], u[-1]=2gL-u[2], u[-2]=2gL-u[3]; and the mirror at the right wall) reproduce g's true smooth extension to every ghost depth the seven-point stencil reaches; the six near-boundary WENO faces see a smooth extension and converge at the interior fifth-order rate -- a clean order-5 gate with nothing to exempt. The linear part 0.5 + x is represented EXACTLY by the discrete Dirichlet operator (the mirror reflection preserves affine data to every ghost depth), so the error comes solely from the sine mode. Geometry contract fulfilled for [0,1]: x0 = 0, dx = 1/N. The ic, forcing, and test references spell x_i = (i - 1/2)/N inline from literals and N (build-time scope-free). Per-resolution error norms pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/hjweno_norm_1d_eikonal_dirichlet_mms/golden/errors.json. Julia integrator tolerances are pinned tight so the temporal truncation stays below the finest spatial error, isolating the spatial order.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_1d",
      "equation:hamilton_jacobi",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Jiang, G.-S., & Peng, D. (2000). Weighted ENO Schemes for Hamilton-Jacobi Equations. SIAM Journal on Scientific Computing, 21(6), 2126-2143. Fifth-order HJ-WENO reconstruction combined by the Godunov Hamiltonian.",
        "doi": "10.1137/S106482759732455X"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Borges, R., Carmona, M., Costa, B., & Don, W. S. (2008). An improved WENO scheme for hyperbolic conservation laws. Journal of Computational Physics, 227(6), 3191-3211. WENO-Z weights recovering fifth order at critical points u_x = 0.",
        "doi": "10.1016/j.jcp.2007.11.038"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Rouy, E., & Tourin, A. (1992). A viscosity solutions approach to shape-from-shading. SIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis, 29(3), 867-884. Convergence of the monotone Godunov Hamiltonian to the viscosity solution of the eikonal equation at first order.",
        "doi": "10.1137/0729053"
      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2007). Finite Difference Methods for Ordinary and Partial Differential Equations. SIAM. Section 2.12 (cell-centered Dirichlet via mirror ghost)."
      },
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "HJWenoEikonalDirichletMMS": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/rules/hjweno_norm_D1_dirichlet_bc.esm"
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "state",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "x"
          ],
          "description": "Level-set field integrated under the forced eikonal u_t = -S*|u_x| + S|g'|; starts at and stays near the manufactured solution g(x) = sin(2 pi x) + 0.5 + x, deviating by the truncation error."
        },
        "S": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1/s",
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Non-negative Hamilton-Jacobi speed. The forcing carries the matching S so g is the exact steady solution for any S > 0."
        },
        "gL": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.5,
          "description": "Prescribed field value at the left wall x=x0 (the rule's Dirichlet free name), equal to the manufactured wall value g(0) = 0.5."
        },
        "gR": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 1.5,
          "description": "Prescribed field value at the right wall x=x0+N*dx (the rule's Dirichlet free name), equal to the manufactured wall value g(1) = 1.5."
        },
        "x0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0,
          "description": "Left domain edge a = 0 (unit interval): the grid's x0 free name (consumer-supplied geometry contract)."
        },
        "dx": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "m",
          "expression": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              1,
              "N"
            ]
          },
          "description": "Grid spacing (b - a)/N = 1/N: the grid's dx free name, resolved inside the rewrite rule's expanded body at evaluation. N is substituted as an integer literal at load (esm-spec 9.7.6)."
        },
        "forcing": {
          "type": "observed",
          "units": "1/s",
          "shape": [
            "x"
          ],
          "description": "The manufactured source |g'(x)| = |2 pi cos(2 pi x_i) + 1| (the S factor folded via the du/dt scaling; x_i = (i - 1/2)/N spelled inline). It exactly balances the continuous operator so g is the steady exact solution; the residual after discretization is the truncation error.",
          "expression": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "x"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "abs",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        6.283185307179586,
                        {
                          "op": "cos",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                6.283185307179586,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "i",
                                        0.5
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        1,
                                        "N"
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    1
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "output_idx": [
              "i"
            ],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": {
              "i": {
                "from": "x"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "+",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "sin",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        6.283185307179586,
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "-",
                              "args": [
                                "i",
                                0.5
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "/",
                              "args": [
                                1,
                                "N"
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                0.5,
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                        "i",
                        0.5
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                        1,
                        "N"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "S",
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  "forcing",
                  {
                    "op": "sqrt",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "^",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "D",
                            "args": [
                              "u"
                            ],
                            "wrt": "x"
                          },
                          2
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_eikonal_dirichlet",
          "description": "Manufactured solution g(x) = sin(2 pi x) + 0.5 + x, S = 1, with prescribed Dirichlet wall values gL = g(0) = 0.5 and gR = g(1) = 1.5. Derivation: u_t = -S|u_x| + S|g'| with u(0) = g gives u_t = 0 at the continuous level, so g is the exact solution for all t; discretely u_t = S*(|g'| - hjweno(u)) and the initial imbalance is the truncation error S*(|g'| - hjweno(g)) = O(dx^5). g = sin(2 pi x) + linear is antisymmetric about both walls, so the antisymmetric mirror-ghost Dirichlet closure reproduces g's true smooth extension one cell outside each wall, and the near-boundary cells retain the interior order. References evaluate g at cell centers x_i = (i - 1/2)/N, spelled inline per esm-spec 6.6.5 (the wall constants 0.5 and slope 1.0 match the gL and (gR - gL) parameter values). The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (L2_error 0 within 1e-9). The t=0.1 assertion bounds the error under the cap 0.001. Exact per-resolution L2/Linf errors are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/hjweno_norm_1d_eikonal_dirichlet_mms/golden/errors.json.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.1
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "x"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "sin",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            6.283185307179586,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "N"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    0.5,
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            "i",
                            0.5
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "/",
                          "args": [
                            1,
                            "N"
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.1,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.001
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "aggregate",
                "output_idx": [
                  "i"
                ],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": {
                  "i": {
                    "from": "x"
                  }
                },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "sin",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            6.283185307179586,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    1,
                                    "N"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    0.5,
                    {
                      "op": "*",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "-",
                          "args": [
                            "i",
                            0.5
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "/",
                          "args": [
                            1,
                            "N"
